Upstream-Name: patrone-installer
Source: https://github.com/billsecond/patrone-linux
Comment: usr/lib/patrone-installer is built from ubuntu-desktop-provision
 (https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-desktop-provision, GPL-3) with
 ubuntu_flavor (https://pub.dev/packages/ubuntu_flavor, MPL-2.0) and the
 Dart and Flutter packages they use, whose licenses are in
 usr/lib/patrone-installer/data/flutter_assets/NOTICES.Z (Flutter, Dart,
 Skia and ICU among them). The fonts and data below aren't in it, so they
 have stanzas of their own.

Files: *
