License: GPL-3+

Files: usr/lib/patrone-installer/*
Copyright: Canonical Ltd and the ubuntu-desktop-provision contributors
           2026 William Daugherty
Comment: Built by installer/build.sh from ubuntu-desktop-provision at the
 commit installer/README.md names, changed by installer/patch_source.py
 (Patrone's pictures in place of Ubuntu's logo, mascot and disk icon, the
 other pictures recolored from Ubuntu's orange to Patrone's blue, the
 spinner, the suggested username, the licence agreement's page; without
 the Landscape choice, Ubuntu's slides or the Windows logo) and
 installer/debrand_l10n.py (its messages). ubuntu_flavor (MPL-2.0, its
 notice in NOTICES.Z) has its Ubuntu flavor's name changed to Patrone Linux.
License: GPL-3

